---
// Real Post-Tax Return Solver Interactive Component
---

<div class="calculator-card" id="real-return-solver">
  <div class="calc-header">
    <div class="badge-row">
      <span class="badge badge-gold">Quantitative Tool</span>
      <span class="badge badge-blue">Exact Fisher Equation</span>
    </div>
    <h3>Real Post-Tax Return Solver</h3>
    <p class="calc-subtitle">
      Calculates the net purchasing-power yield after deducting Indian capital gains/slab taxes and macroeconomic CPI or lifestyle inflation drag.
    </p>
  </div>

  <form id="real-return-form" class="calc-form" onsubmit="return false;">
    <div class="calc-grid">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="nominal-rate" class="form-label">
          Nominal Pre-Tax Return (% p.a.)
          <span class="tooltip" title="Expected gross annual growth before tax and inflation.">ⓘ</span>
        </label>
        <input
          type="number"
          id="nominal-rate"
          class="form-control"
          step="0.1"
          min="-50"
          max="100"
          value="12.0"
          required
        />
        <span class="input-hint">e.g. 12% for Nifty 50 TRI, 7.5% for Corporate FD</span>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="inflation-rate" class="form-label">
          Inflation Rate (% p.a.)
          <span class="tooltip" title="Annual erosion of purchasing power.">ⓘ</span>
        </label>
        <input
          type="number"
          id="inflation-rate"
          class="form-control"
          step="0.1"
          min="0"
          max="50"
          value="6.0"
          required
        />
        <span class="input-hint">RBI target is 4.0% (+/-2%); Urban education/health is ~8-10%</span>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="asset-tax-type" class="form-label">Asset Class / Tax Category</label>
        <select id="asset-tax-type" class="form-control">
          <option value="equity_ltcg" selected>Equity LTCG (12.5% post-Finance Act 2024)</option>
          <option value="equity_stcg">Equity STCG (20.0% post-Finance Act 2024)</option>
          <option value="debt_slab">Debt Fund / Fixed Income (Slab Rate: 31.2%)</option>
          <option value="fd_slab">Fixed Deposit / Savings (Slab Rate: 31.2%)</option>
          <option value="custom">Custom Tax Rate (%)</option>
        </select>
        <span class="input-hint">Finance (No. 2) Act 2024 revised rates</span>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group" id="custom-tax-container" style="display: none;">
        <label for="custom-tax-rate" class="form-label">Custom Tax Rate (%)</label>
        <input
          type="number"
          id="custom-tax-rate"
          class="form-control"
          step="0.1"
          min="0"
          max="60"
          value="12.5"
        />
        <span class="input-hint">Include surcharge and 4% Health & Education cess</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="button-row">
      <button type="button" id="btn-calc-real-return" class="btn btn-gold">Solve Real Return</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-reset-real-return" class="btn">Reset to Standard Scenario</button>
    </div>
  </form>

  <div id="real-return-results" class="results-panel" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="results-grid">
      <div class="result-tile highlight-tile">
        <span class="tile-label">Exact Real Return (Fisher Equation)</span>
        <span class="tile-value value-primary" id="res-exact-real">--</span>
        <span class="tile-subtext" id="res-formula-explanation">Formula: (1 + r_net) / (1 + i) - 1</span>
      </div>

      <div class="result-tile">
        <span class="tile-label">Nominal Post-Tax Yield</span>
        <span class="tile-value" id="res-nominal-post-tax">--</span>
        <span class="tile-subtext" id="res-tax-applied">Effective tax drag: --</span>
      </div>

      <div class="result-tile">
        <span class="tile-label">Approximate Rule-of-Thumb</span>
        <span class="tile-value" id="res-approx-real">--</span>
        <span class="tile-subtext">Overstatement error: <span id="res-error-gap">--</span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="result-tile">
        <span class="tile-label">10-Year Purchasing Power Multiplier</span>
        <span class="tile-value" id="res-purchasing-power">--</span>
        <span class="tile-subtext" id="res-wealth-narrative">Real wealth expansion</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="callout callout-warning math-insight">
      <h5>Mathematical Context: The Fisher Exact Identity</h5>
      <p>
        The widely used shortcut <code>Real Return = Nominal - Inflation</code> fails at compounding multi-year horizons. The true Fisher relationship is:
      </p>
      <p style="text-align: center; font-family: var(--iq-font-mono); font-weight: 600;">
        (1 + r_nominal_net) = (1 + r_real) × (1 + i)  ⟹  r_real = [(1 + r_nominal_net) / (1 + i)] - 1
      </p>
      <p>
        Because inflation erodes both the principal <em>and</em> the returns earned during the year, the approximate formula consistently overstates purchasing-power growth.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  (function() {
    const nominalInput = document.getElementById('nominal-rate');
    const inflationInput = document.getElementById('inflation-rate');
    const taxSelect = document.getElementById('asset-tax-type');
    const customTaxContainer = document.getElementById('custom-tax-container');
    const customTaxInput = document.getElementById('custom-tax-rate');
    const calcBtn = document.getElementById('btn-calc-real-return');
    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('btn-reset-real-return');

    if (!nominalInput || !inflationInput || !taxSelect || !calcBtn) return;

    taxSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
      if (taxSelect.value === 'custom') {
        customTaxContainer.style.display = 'block';
      } else {
        customTaxContainer.style.display = 'none';
      }
      runCalculation();
    });

    nominalInput.addEventListener('input', runCalculation);
    inflationInput.addEventListener('input', runCalculation);
    customTaxInput.addEventListener('input', runCalculation);
    calcBtn.addEventListener('click', runCalculation);

    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      nominalInput.value = '12.0';
      inflationInput.value = '6.0';
      taxSelect.value = 'equity_ltcg';
      customTaxContainer.style.display = 'none';
      runCalculation();
    });

    function getTaxRate() {
      switch (taxSelect.value) {
        case 'equity_ltcg': return 0.125;
        case 'equity_stcg': return 0.20;
        case 'debt_slab': return 0.312;
        case 'fd_slab': return 0.312;
        case 'custom': return (parseFloat(customTaxInput.value) || 0) / 100;
        default: return 0.125;
      }
    }

    function runCalculation() {
      const nominal = (parseFloat(nominalInput.value) || 0) / 100;
      const inflation = (parseFloat(inflationInput.value) || 0) / 100;
      const taxRate = getTaxRate();

      const nominalPostTax = nominal * (1 - taxRate);
      const exactReal = (1 + nominalPostTax) / (1 + inflation) - 1;
      const approxReal = nominalPostTax - inflation;
      const tenYearMultiplier = Math.pow(1 + exactReal, 10);
      const taxDragPct = (nominal - nominalPostTax) * 100;
      const errorGap = (approxReal - exactReal) * 100;

      // Update DOM
      const exactEl = document.getElementById('res-exact-real');
      const postTaxEl = document.getElementById('res-nominal-post-tax');
      const approxEl = document.getElementById('res-approx-real');
      const ppEl = document.getElementById('res-purchasing-power');
      const taxAppliedEl = document.getElementById('res-tax-applied');
      const errorGapEl = document.getElementById('res-error-gap');
      const wealthNarEl = document.getElementById('res-wealth-narrative');

      if (exactEl) {
        exactEl.textContent = (exactReal * 100).toFixed(2) + '%';
        exactEl.className = 'tile-value ' + (exactReal >= 0 ? 'value-positive' : 'value-negative');
      }

      if (postTaxEl) {
        postTaxEl.textContent = (nominalPostTax * 100).toFixed(2) + '%';
      }

      if (taxAppliedEl) {
        taxAppliedEl.textContent = `Tax drag: -${taxDragPct.toFixed(2)}% (Tax: ${(taxRate * 100).toFixed(1)}%)`;
      }

      if (approxEl) {
        approxEl.textContent = (approxReal * 100).toFixed(2) + '%';
      }

      if (errorGapEl) {
        errorGapEl.textContent = `+${errorGap.toFixed(2)}% overstatement`;
      }

      if (ppEl) {
        ppEl.textContent = tenYearMultiplier.toFixed(2) + 'x';
      }

      if (wealthNarEl) {
        if (exactReal < 0) {
          wealthNarEl.textContent = 'Purchasing power is decaying over time';
          wealthNarEl.style.color = 'var(--iq-danger)';
        } else {
          wealthNarEl.textContent = `10y real buying power expands by ${((tenYearMultiplier - 1) * 100).toFixed(1)}%`;
          wealthNarEl.style.color = 'var(--iq-success)';
        }
      }
    }

    // Run initial on mount
    runCalculation();
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .calculator-card {
    background-color: var(--iq-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--iq-border);
    border-radius: var(--iq-radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--iq-shadow-md);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .calc-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .calc-subtitle {
    color: var(--iq-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .calc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .input-hint {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--iq-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .button-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .results-panel {
    background-color: var(--iq-surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--iq-border);
    border-radius: var(--iq-radius-md);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .results-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .result-tile {
    background-color: var(--iq-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--iq-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--iq-radius-md);
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .highlight-tile {
    border-color: var(--iq-rupee-gold);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--iq-surface) 0%, var(--iq-rupee-gold-glow) 100%);
  }

  .tile-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--iq-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tile-value {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--iq-font-mono);
  }

  .value-primary {
    color: var(--iq-rupee-gold);
  }

  .value-positive {
    color: var(--iq-success);
  }

  .value-negative {
    color: var(--iq-danger);
  }

  .tile-subtext {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--iq-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .math-insight h5 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
